ing records a Lean proof of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-full-support"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-full-support"],"id":"long.thm-full-support","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 5.4 (Full-support irrationality, unconditional, every base $`b \\ge 2`$)","locator":"Long record Theorem 5.4, p. 38, label thm:full-support","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every integer $b \\ge 2$,\n$$\n\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{b^{k+1}-1} \\quad \\text{is irrational.}\n$$\n**Hypotheses:** $b \\in \\mathbb{N}$, $b \\ge 2$. **Conclusion:** unconditional irrationality of the full-support Erdős–Borwein-type series at every base, not merely base $2$. The base-$2$ instance recovering the classical Erdős–Borwein constant’s irrationality is a one-line corollary.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-full-support","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-full-support","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.thm-full-support","id":"field:c3fcca312ab34e5ca0ec8c0e237287b630e6284265f2264899dab3e6a4ba610a","kind":"c